Title:                 batt
Version:               2005-02-09
Entered-date:          2020-12-21
Modified-date:         2020-12-21.0
Description:           tiny program to display information about current power and battery status
Summary:               BATT is a tiny program to display information about current power and battery status (remaining charge and operational time), which may be critical in mobile environments but not easily available when working under DOS, even that easily available through the Advanced Power Management BIOS interface. It is designed to run under plain DOS and may not work under MS Windows.
Changes:               New package for FreeDOS
